---
name: heading
type: registry:ui
title: Heading
description: A semantic heading that decouples the heading level from its visual size, weight, and tone.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/heading/heading.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/heading/heading.svelte'
  - path: registry/items/components/heading/heading.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/heading/heading.types.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/heading/heading.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/heading/heading.variants.ts'
---

Pick `level` for document semantics and `size` for the visual scale, so a page can keep a single `h1`
without being locked into the largest type size.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import Heading from '~/components/heading/heading.svelte';
</script>

<Heading level={1} size="2xl">Design system</Heading>
<Heading level={2} size="md" tone="muted">Components</Heading>
```
